  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The number of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> for which the system of linear equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;has no solution is :</p><p>We know that for the system of equation has no solution,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>21</mn><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>42</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;(ignoring negative sign as it will not lie in range of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>)</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>13</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>17</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, total number of solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
